Z||000011||LAMBO||05-03-2000||09:34 AM||||This is the first chat forum I've joined so I'm not sure how to tell which number I am.<P>Hey batboy, I live 15 miles east of I-35 at the Osceola exit, over by Stephens State Forest,(yes, we have a few forests in Iowa). Look for a greenhouse at Lucas, IA. Everybody knows us.<P>I didn't have any luck on the 86 GT. The guy hadn't had it very long. Wasn't in a dealing mood. Try back in a month or so. <P>How do you post photos on this forum? A cut and paste didn't seem to work. Is there a certain format photos need to be in before they can be posted? GIF, jpeg, ?||||reg||1
